$$$text/vnd.tiddlywiki.mermaid
flowchart TD
    subgraph UI ["表现层 (React + Editor)"]
        Reader["双栏文献阅读器 (PDF / Web)"]
        Outliner["层级大纲树 (Hierarchy Editor)"]
        Queue["复习会话 (FSRS / SM2 / Exponential)"]
    end

    subgraph DataModel ["领域核心层 (WASM Graph Engine)"]
        Rem["统一基元: Rem (一切皆 Rem)"]
        Cards["卡片派生: WrappedCardType (Concept / Cloze / Occlusion)"]
        Graph["拓扑图缓存: wasmGraph (快速计算树后代与牌组归属)"]
    end

    subgraph Storage ["持久化层 (Electron + SQLite Server)"]
        SQLite["SQLite (better-sqlite3 + WAL模式)"]
        FTS["FTS5 + libsimple 中文结巴分词"]
        Backup["自动化轮转备份 (按日/周压缩 zip)"]
    end

    Reader --> Rem
    Outliner --> Rem
    Rem --> Cards
    Cards --> Queue
    Rem --> Graph
    Graph --> SQLite